        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to have the bragging rights to say &quot;I have a 1 in a million achievement on Steam&quot;? Well today is your lucky day because that is what this entire game is based on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong> Get a score of 1,000,000 all you have to do is click a button and hope it hits the 1,000,000 and you will now have that achievement, you can purchase upgrades that allow for an auto clicker and reduce the time between clicks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also side achievements that can be acquired such as 1% which is a score of 1, Full stop, which is a score of 999,999 and upgraded, which is acquired by purchasing all upgrades, if you get those 4 plus the 1 million, then you will have the King of Achievements achievement which is by far the rarest of rare when it comes to achievements, this game can take years to 100% or it could take a single day, it's all based on odds, you might get very lucky your first couple clicks</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to have the bragging rights to say &quot;I have a 1 in a million achievement on Steam&quot;? Well today is your lucky day because that is what this entire game is based on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective:</strong> Get a score of 1,000,000 all you have to do is click a button and hope it hits the 1,000,000 and you will now have that achievement, you can purchase upgrades that allow for an auto clicker and reduce the time between clicks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also side achievements that can be acquired such as 1% which is a score of 1, Full stop, which is a score of 999,999 and upgraded, which is acquired by purchasing all upgrades, if you get those 4 plus the 1 million, then you will have the King of Achievements achievement which is by far the rarest of rare when it comes to achievements, this game can take years to 100% or it could take a single day, it's all based on odds, you might get very lucky your first couple clicks</p>",
